    lat: 41.0992,
    lng: -80.6495,
    radius: 1800,
    short: "Immigrant steel labor from a dozen countries. Youngstown State grew out of a YMCA school. Stambaugh Auditorium is the civic room the mills paid for. A city of shifts.",
