    name: "Soldiers Sailors Pioneers Monument",
    lat: 39.3988,
    lng: -84.5608,
    radius: 400,
    short: "Limestone tower on the fort site. Civil War veterans paid for it. You are standing where pack trains left for the woods in 1791.",
