    lat: 39.5150,
    lng: -84.3983,
    radius: 1800,
    short: "Great Miami corridor. Shawnee and Miami hunting ground. Same valley as Fort Hamilton and Dayton. Settlement after Greenville. No fort of its own. A middle crossing.",
