    lat: 40.0581,
    lng: -82.4013,
    radius: 1500,
    short: "Moundbuilders Country Club is the uneasy neighbor of the Octagon. Dawes Arboretum sits south. A county that kept trees and earthworks in the same breath as glass and insurance.",
