    lat: 40.5887,
    lng: -83.1285,
    radius: 1800,
    short: "Wyandot and Delaware hunting ground on the Scioto tributaries. Named for a Revolutionary partisan. Harding left this town for the Senate and the war-after-the-war presidency.",
