    name: "Piqua name",
    lat: 40.1448,
    lng: -84.2424,
    radius: 1200,
    short: "Ask what Piqua means and you will get three answers and a shrug. The legend worth keeping is simpler: the town kept a Shawnee name on purpose while it built a canal city on top.",
